Reset Abilities
    Events
        Unit - A unit Acquires an item
    Conditions
        (Item-type of (Item being manipulated)) Equal to Reset Abilities
    Actions
        -------- Reset all abilities from the unit (=remove abilities) --------
        Set VariableSet DInv_SourceUnit = (Triggering unit)
        Custom script:   call DItemTransfer_StoreSourceUnit()
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Triggering unit) Equal to Nazgrek
            Then - Actions
                -------- NAZGREK --------
                Unit - Replace Nazgrek with a Nazgrek using The old unit's relative life and mana
                Set VariableSet AbilityPointsNazgrek = ((Hero level of (Triggering unit)) + 3)
                Trigger - Run MultiboardUpdateAbilityPoints <gen> (checking conditions)
                Set VariableSet Nazgrek = (Last replaced unit)
                Set VariableSet DInv_TargetUnit = (Last replaced unit)
                -------- Inventory & Equipment System --------
                Custom script:   call InitializeDInventoryForUnit(udg_Nazgrek)
                Custom script:   call InitializeDEquipmentForUnit(udg_Nazgrek)
                Custom script:   call DItemTransfer_TransferDItemsGUI()
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Triggering unit) Equal to Zulkis
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Zul'kis (ranged)
